From b5fcf5ac9d6c72ad78032a788ac32cd681995a0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wowodymyr <kokesiskigovno@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:49:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/25] WebPorn: build and run JSC/WebCore/WebKitLegacy on
 armv7 iOS 8.4.1

- PlatformIOS.cmake for WebCore and WebKitLegacy; iOS feature set in
  OptionsMac.cmake / WebKitFeatures.cmake
- LLVM 21: offlineasm arm.rb literal pools instead of movw/movt addends
- clang modules guard (WEBPORN_NO_CLANG_MODULES) in SPI headers
- armv7 thread VFP flush-to-zero off (Threading.cpp)
- bmalloc platform detection for WK26_IOS_TARGET
- SoftLinking.h: missing framework/symbol degrades to a logged no-op on
  WK26_IOS_TARGET instead of RELEASE_ASSERT
- iOS 8 guards in PAL SPI headers, compression, media session, CFNet

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
